        "description": "~!__Gender__: Female!~\n\nAfter seeing his swordsmanship, Dororo decides to follow Hyakkimaru. Dororo was a thief before meeting Hyakkimaru.\n\n~!Dororo's bandit father Hibukuro was wounded by a samurai official and later died. Her mother froze to death while fleeing in the snow, but before she died she drew a map on Dororo's back to locate money hidden by her father at Bone Cape.\n\nHyakkimaru learns that Dororo is female with the latter continuously insisting she is a boy, though this is because her parents raised her as one.!~",
